sequenceDiagram
    participant J as archive_partition
    participant R as BILLING_RECORDS (month M)
    participant X as BILLING_XCHG
    participant A as BILLING_ARCHIVE
    participant L as DLM_JOB_LOG
    J->>X: rows left by an interrupted run?
    alt rows of month M staged
        J->>L: RESUMED
    else normal path
        J->>R: warm first if needed, count rows, READ WRITE
        J->>R: EXCHANGE PARTITION with X (update global indexes)
        Note over R,X: metadata swap - no row copied
    end
    J->>A: LOCK PARTITION FOR (M) - creates the interval partition
    J->>A: EXCHANGE PARTITION with X (including indexes)
    J->>A: verify row count, READ ONLY
    J->>R: DROP the empty partition (update global indexes)
    J->>L: OK (rows, elapsed)
